+## Peephole (ECR-002)
+
+Drill the door brick Ø25 mm at chamber mid-height, 60 mm right of centre, to line up with
+the Ø25 mm holes in the door skin and door fiber (in their DXFs).
+
 ## Open points for quotation
 
 - Standoffs for the guard (M6 × 25 mm spacers, 16 off) are not drawn; supply from stock.
